  <item>
    <title>【江湖快讯】多位华语导演齐聚本届戛纳电影节，贾樟柯能否摘得金棕榈大奖，涛姐能否一举拿下影后桂冠</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663f53a6af1e22bb15accee7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663f53a6af1e22bb15accee7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 11 May 2024 11:16:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024年第77届戛纳电影节多位华语导演作品即将展映，贾樟柯《风流一代》 娄烨《一部未完成的电影》 陈可辛《酱园弄》 管虎《狗镇》 郑保瑞《九龙城寨之围城》。贾樟柯能否摘得金棕榈大奖，赵涛能否涛声依旧，夺得戛纳影后，成败在此一举。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>贾樟柯《风流一代》，意图明确</span></p><span></span><p><span>究竟是自我致敬，构建贾樟柯电影宇宙，还是自我重复、自我背叛？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loLbwY1IJy74gBbGo1Q0ztmDoPVV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>娄烨《一部未完成的电影》，娄烨和他曾经的男演员们</span></p><span></span><p><span>《春晚》剧组重聚，陈思诚该反思，为何唯独少了自己</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft0v3pPxswWXGdFj4sfIQmkFXRZS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陈可辛《酱园弄》，民国四大奇案，另外三案是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈导依然是中国心，兜兜转转还是回归祖国拍电影。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lglhZMkgXqIFoU5-Wtziik0B_rJC.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
