    <title>【银幕江湖】贾樟柯的电影世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6625278d200abebe6e4d80f6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6625278d200abebe6e4d80f6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Apr 2024 14:49:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是我们第一期节目，我们诚邀上海理工大学讲师——季泓一老师，共同走进贾樟柯的电影世界，从他的早期作品到如今的代表作，我们将回顾他的导演生涯中五部重要的电影作品，探讨他独特的拍摄风格以及他作品背后的文化意义。贾樟柯的电影作品如何反映了中国社会的变迁？他又是如何用镜头捕捉人性的微妙变化？一起来探索导演在银幕上的江湖！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> &nbsp;本期内容简介——</span><em><strong><span>贾樟柯导演生涯回顾</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 贾樟柯生涯阶段性介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> </span><strong><span>《小武》——失落的伤怀</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> “生活的毛边”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 在窃国者诸侯的时代，关注窃钩者</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">10:45</a> </span><strong><span>《站台》——“一个朋友，普希金”</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1416">23:36</a> 成功的第六代 ——“圆通”的文工团团长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1571">26:11</a> &nbsp;断代的中国导演、失语的中国电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a>“江山不可复识矣”集体记忆的表达能否重现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a> </span><strong><span>《三峡好人》——一幅时代卷轴画</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2279">37:59</a> 优秀电影开场——《寄生虫》《现代启示录》《小丑》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 大刀阔斧的工程与外来文明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> </span><strong><span>《天注定》——反抗与反抗的徒劳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3299">54:59</a> 社会热点事件的沉淀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3411">56:51</a> 这件事要怎么说出口？娄烨、姜文、田壮壮、王小帅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> &nbsp;上戏往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3871">64:31</a> </span><strong><span>《江湖儿女》—— 导演的转型</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4525">75:25</a> 真实的荒诞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4660">77:40</a></span><strong><span> 尾声——《倾心》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢本期节目，欢迎点赞收藏，这将是我们完成下一期节目的巨大动力！</span></p>]]></description>
